e Pauline corpus and the Acts of the Apostles (Acts + James + 1 Peter + 1 John), which is a stage in the formation of the Peshitta for the final assemblage of which the separate Gospels will replace the &lt;i&gt;Diatessaron&lt;/i&gt;.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
